      "writtenOn": "2025-02-10T03:39:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Although initIfNeeded is synchronous, this method is not, thus you cannot rely on bloomFilter not changing.\n\nAlso, I should clarify that this change is a refactoring, so generally I am trying to make it easy to review by altering as little as possible in the logic of the code. I am mostly trying to just hoist the code out of the calling class into this class so that a reviewer can look at it and say \"yup, looks the same\". I am tyring to keep any improvements to the logic to before and after the refactor change so that they stand out and can be reviewed on their own merrit.",
